            },
            "kind": "REWORK",
            "comments": [
                {
                    "file": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
                    "line": 0,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Andrew Geissler",
                        "email": "geissonator@yahoo.com",
                        "username": "geissonator"
                    },
                    "message": "I think we should post this in discord (or maybe mailing list) to allow others to review/weigh in. I still struggle a bit with the fact that it's tough to find maintainers so removing them doesn't seem right in some ways, but I understand the overall desire to have more active maintainers in the project, hence my +1."
                },
                {
                    "file": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
                    "line": 0,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Brad Bishop",
                        "email": "bradleyb@fuzziesquirrel.com",
                        "username": "bradbishop"
                    },
                    "message": "I had this same thought, we are hurting for maintainers so why are we itching to remove the ones we have.  I think the answer is that the folks being removed aren't really doing the work and thus the actual need is better reflected, potentially attracting a new maintainer that may not have otherwise engaged."
                },
                {
                    "file": "community-membership.md",
                    "line": 214,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Deepak Kodihalli",
                        "email": "deepak.kodihalli.83@gmail.com",
                        "username": "dkodihal"
                    },
                    "message": "+1 to this, but is this not applicable to Approver above?"
                },
                {
                    "file": "community-membership.md",
                    "line": 214,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Hariharan Rangasamy",
                        "email": "hariharanr@ami.com",
                        "username": "hariharanrangasamy"
                    },
                    "message": "I have same question. should approvers also be required to maintain active status?\n\nIf they are actively reviewing or contributing, it should count toward meeting or exceeding the active status.\u201d"
                },
                {
                    "file": "community-membership.md",
                    "line": 214,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Patrick Williams",
                        "email": "patrick@stwcx.xyz",
                        "username": "williamspatrick"
                    },
                    "message": "The Approver section is strange.  It is essentially a \"owner\" of a subset of a repository.  I think it is reasonable to expect them to have similar expectations as the Subproject Owner."
                },
                {
                    "file": "community-membership.md",
                    "line": 214,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Patrick Williams",
                        "email": "patrick@stwcx.xyz",
                        "username": "williamspatrick"
                    },
                    "message": "Done"
                }
            ],
